Easy GPG is now Easy PGP

The app implements OpenPGP, not GnuPG, so the old name pointed at software it does not contain. Nothing about how it works has changed and your keys are untouched.

Fixed

• Obfuscated messages carried the marker twice at each end. A repeated marker is easier to spot than a single one, which worked against the point of hiding it. Messages sent by earlier versions still decrypt.

Alpha software. Not audited.
